      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "5 JUSTICE KENNEDY: Well, but abuse of\n6 discretion doesn't mean that the judge operates in a\n7 vacuum. If we make -- issue an opinion and say, oh,\n8 well, that the standard is an abuse of discretion, that\n9 doesn't tell people too much. Abuse of discretion based\n10 on what standards, what inquiries? And that's -- and\n11 I'd like to know what your position is on that, because\n12 it seems to me that, at the end of the day, it's going\n13 to be something very close to interests of justice."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2011-10-1265",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5921cebd03841ea3ffe3f79fc751b051960e86213b1eb940f75fd13418d6a3de",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5921cebd0384-0001-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 22,
        "start": 22
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "24 JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: Counsel, can I give you\n25 an example? Beginning of the litigation, all right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2011-10-1265",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5921cebd03841ea3ffe3f79fc751b051960e86213b1eb940f75fd13418d6a3de",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5921cebd0384-0001-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "13 JUSTICE SCALIA: A volunteer issue? What\n14 are you talking about? I'm --\n15 MR. CAMPBELL: A volunteer issue is when\n16 someone says: I do not want to pursue my remedies; I\n17 want to simply be executed. In the practice, we call\n18 that a volunteer.\n19 JUSTICE SCALIA: You call that a\n20 volunteer --\n21 MR CAMPBELL: We call that a volunteer."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Waxman",
      "case_id": "2011-10-1265",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5921cebd03841ea3ffe3f79fc751b051960e86213b1eb940f75fd13418d6a3de",
